      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DuPont%2C_Washington",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Sequalitchew Archeological midden, the oldest known in Washington, sits within DuPont and was listed in 1975.",
